1
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:06,730
God, that is the most beautiful engagement ring ever!
這真是世上最美的訂婚戒指

2
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:10,430
You should know. You bought, like, a billion of them.
你一定很識貨，你買過一大堆

3
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:12,930
You didn't get one.
但是你沒有

4
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:17,910
-Tonight's the big night. -How you gonna ask her?
-好，就是今晚了  -你要怎麼進行？

5
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:21,140
We're gonna go to her favorite restaurant.
保證完美 我會帶她上她最愛的餐廳

7
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:26,410
I'm gonna get her favorite champagne. She'll know how expensive it is.
我要送她一瓶她很喜歡的香檳 那她就知道有多貴了

8
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:33,250
When the glasses are full, instead of proposing a toast, I'm gonna propose.
然後等酒斟好了，我不會敬酒 我會向她求婚

10
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:35,930
It sounds perfect!
好棒喔

11
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:40,800
-You'll mess it up. Let me do it. -I won't mess it up.
-你會搞砸 讓我來吧  -我才不會搞砸  

12
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,030
-lf she says no,can I have the ring? -She won't say no.
-要是她說不，戒指可以給我嗎  -她不會說不

14
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:46,740
If.
要是

16
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:50,410
-Sure. -What about me? I want it too.
-沒問題  -那我呢？我也想要

18
00:00:50,950 --> 00:00:54,010
-She won't say no. -I'll let you borrow it.
-她不會說不  -我再借給你

20
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:00,710
Hey,Monica.

21
00:01:03,730 --> 00:01:05,590
-Give it. -It's gone.
-還給我 -吞下去了

22
00:01:07,030 --> 00:01:08,550
Phoebe.
菲比

23
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:13,970
Hey,Monica!

24
00:01:16,100 --> 00:01:18,000
We're practically kissing.
我們在接吻喔

25
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:22,810
The One With the Proposal
本集播出：「驚喜的求婚」

00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,810
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

26
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:02,610
Anyone free tonight? My boss is hosting a charity event for kids.
晚上有人有空嗎？ 我主管要主持救助貧童慈善會

29
00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:06,950
The more people I bring, the better I look. Monica? Chandler?
我帶越多人去越有面子 摩妮卡？錢德？

30
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:10,180
We can't go. We're going to dinner. Remember?
摩妮卡和錢德不能去 我們要去吃飯，記得嗎？

32
00:02:10,390 --> 00:02:13,950
-Oh,my God. I'm so sorry. -What's the big deal?
-天哪，真抱歉  -幹嘛這麼激動？

34
00:02:14,730 --> 00:02:19,030
I get mad when Rachel doesn't remember where we're going.
我只是很氣瑞秋不記得 我們要去哪裡

35
00:02:20,570 --> 00:02:22,330
Where are you going?
你們要去哪裡？

36
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:26,060
-How about you guys? -Open bar?
-那你們呢？ -酒品免費？ 

37
00:02:26,770 --> 00:02:29,740
-I think so. -I can do that for the kids.
-應該是  -我可以為孩子們喝酒

39
00:02:30,810 --> 00:02:35,110
I'll come. I'm making money. It's time I give some back.
那我也要去 我現在有收入 也該回饋社會了

41
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:38,010
You could give back the money you owe me.
你也可以把欠我的錢還給我

42
00:02:38,990 --> 00:02:41,250
Okay. Have a benefit.
好啊，你辦義賣啊

43
00:02:44,190 --> 00:02:47,160
Ross, can you go to a charity event tonight?
羅斯 你晚上可以參加慈善晚會嗎？

44
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:49,300
I have plans with Elizabeth.
不行，我跟伊麗莎白有約

45
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:52,560
You're already doing your part for the kids.
你已經在為孩童貢獻心力了

46
00:02:54,370 --> 00:02:59,030
It's our last night before she leaves for camp. To be a counselor.
再過幾天她要去夏令營 去當指導員

48
00:03:00,740 --> 00:03:05,650
I have a question. All jokes aside, where is this relationship going?
羅斯 我問你 撇開笑話不提 這段感情要往哪裡走？

50
00:03:05,850 --> 00:03:08,940
All jokes aside? I didn't agree to that.
等等，撇開笑話不提？ 我可不同意

51
00:03:10,390 --> 00:03:13,720
-Do you see this as long-term? -I don't know.
-你認為你們可以長久嗎？ -我不知道

52
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:17,260
-You are 12 years older than her. -Who's counting?
-你比她大12歲喔  -誰會去算？

53
00:03:17,460 --> 00:03:19,890
Well,she is. She's this many.
她會，她才這麼大

55
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:24,120
Ross, she is really young.
羅斯，她真的很年輕

56
00:03:24,830 --> 00:03:27,030
Does everyone feel this way?
等等，你們都這麼認為嗎？

57
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:29,330
-Yeah,sort of. -Sorry.
有一點 抱歉

58
00:03:30,540 --> 00:03:34,500
I thought you were just making jokes. I had no idea.
我以為你們只是愛開玩笑 我都不知道

59
00:03:34,710 --> 00:03:39,270
You guys are wrong. Yes,there is a chronological age difference.
不過你們都錯了 沒錯，我們是有年齡上的差異

61
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:43,180
But I never notice it, because she is very mature.
但是我都感覺不到 為什麼？因為她很成熟

62
00:03:43,380 --> 00:03:48,120
It doesn't matter what you guys think. I'm dating Elizabeth, not you.
況且我根本不在意你們的看法 跟她交往的是我，不是你們

64
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:50,660
Not what she said last night.
她昨晚可不是這麼說的

65
00:03:52,690 --> 00:03:54,660
See,now,he could date her.
他配她就夠幼稚

66
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:01,100
Will you marry me?
你願意嫁給我嗎？

67
00:04:02,300 --> 00:04:04,170
Will you marry me?
你願意嫁給我嗎？

68
00:04:04,370 --> 00:04:06,170
Hey, you marry me.
嫁給我

69
00:04:13,620 --> 00:04:18,450
-What's going on, little elves? -It's the big night. We wish you luck.
-怎麼了，小精靈們？ -今晚很重要，我們想祝你好運

71
00:04:18,650 --> 00:04:20,920
-You have the ring? -In my pocket.
戒指帶了嗎？ 就在口袋裡

72
00:04:26,230 --> 00:04:27,890
-Phoebe. -Wha..?
菲比

73
00:04:30,530 --> 00:04:34,430
Will you guys get out of here? This is a surprise.
麻煩你們出去 我想給她驚喜，她會看出來

74
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:37,230
Yeah,you guys. Get out of here.
沒錯，快出去

75
00:04:39,270 --> 00:04:40,830
Hey,guys.
你們好

76
00:04:42,980 --> 00:04:46,280
-You look beautiful. -Thank you.
-你好漂亮 -謝謝

78
00:04:52,290 --> 00:04:53,980
What's going on?
怎麼了？

79
00:04:54,190 --> 00:04:56,050
We're just really...
我們只是… 

80
00:04:56,260 --> 00:04:59,920
excited about this charity event we have to go to.
要參加慈善晚會覺得很興奮

81
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:06,760
-Here. -Thank you.
給你 謝謝

82
00:05:06,970 --> 00:05:11,270
-So, what's going on here? -Well,this is a silent auction.
-現在是怎樣？ -這是一場不喊價拍賣會

84
00:05:11,470 --> 00:05:14,960
They lay the stuff here. You write down your offer.
要賣的東西都在這裡 你寫下競標價

85
00:05:15,180 --> 00:05:17,240
Then the highest bid gets it.
出價最高的就是得主

86
00:05:17,450 --> 00:05:21,940
I know what a silent auction is. What's going on with your hair?
我知道什麼叫不喊價拍賣會 我是說你的頭髮怎麼了？

88
00:05:23,690 --> 00:05:26,380
-Why? -No,it's nice.
-怎麼說？ -不是啊，很好看

90
00:05:27,890 --> 00:05:31,050
Nice to see you. So glad you brought someone.
歡迎 你帶了一位朋友來

91
00:05:31,260 --> 00:05:33,060
Someone? I brought people.
一位？我帶了兩位 

92
00:05:33,260 --> 00:05:37,820
Phoebe, this is Mr. Thompson. He's the head of my department.
菲比，這位是湯普森先生 他是我的部門主管

94
00:05:38,030 --> 00:05:41,900
-And I also brought my friend Joey. -Shrimp toast!
-我還帶了我的朋友喬伊… -蝦子吐司

96
00:05:43,170 --> 00:05:46,270
You know, I don't know where he is.
我不知道他在哪裡

97
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,600
I hope you'll bid.
希望你會參加競標

98
00:05:48,810 --> 00:05:52,800
Actually,I was about to bid on this lovely trip to Paris.
我正打算投標這趟巴黎之旅

99
00:05:53,010 --> 00:05:56,310
-Nice choice. Good luck. -Thank you.
-有眼光，祝你好運  -謝謝

100
00:05:57,620 --> 00:05:58,610
Okay.
好

101
00:05:58,820 --> 00:06:01,220
Twenty dollars.
20元

102
00:06:09,260 --> 00:06:11,730
Shut the door! Shut the door!
把門關上，把門關上

103
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:15,630
-What's going on? -Guys are throwing water balloons.
-怎麼了？ -對面的男生在朝我們丟水球

105
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:19,640
Call the cops. That's what I did to kids in my building.
你們得報警 我都這樣對付我家那棟的小孩

106
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:23,570
No, it's a water balloon fight. We started it.
這是水球仗，是我們挑起的

107
00:06:25,010 --> 00:06:29,240
I stopped by to see if you wanted to see this play tonight.
聽我說 我來問你晚上要不要去看戲

108
00:06:29,450 --> 00:06:31,750
It's excellent. The director is..
這齣戲應該很棒，導演…

109
00:06:31,950 --> 00:06:35,890
-Who drank all the kamikazes? -Nobody. We put them in here!
-誰把神風特攻隊都喝了？ -沒有，在水球裡

111
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:38,280
You want some?
你要嗎？ 不要

112
00:06:40,190 --> 00:06:44,390
-Could I talk to you for a second? -Yeah,sure.
我可以跟你講一下話嗎？ 當然可以

113
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:46,970
So this play, what do you think?
所以你要去看戲嗎？ 

115
00:06:47,170 --> 00:06:50,000
-It's gotten great reviews.. -Attack!
-它的劇評很好…  -攻擊！

117
00:06:52,210 --> 00:06:55,700
-Put your balloons down! -You put your balloons down!
-放下水球 -你們才放下

118
00:06:55,910 --> 00:07:00,440
Everybody put their balloons down!
統統都把水球放下

120
00:07:02,350 --> 00:07:05,550
Now,this is a nice suit!
這可是高級西裝

121
00:07:09,620 --> 00:07:11,180
If you'll excuse us...
請你們出去一下 

122
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:15,850
I would like to speak to Elizabeth alone for a moment.
我要單獨跟伊麗莎白談談

123
00:07:18,570 --> 00:07:21,500
Whoa,Liz. Your dad's a bummer.
麗莎，你爸好掃興

124
00:07:24,710 --> 00:07:28,200
Our next item is the romantic trip to Paris.
下一項拍賣品是巴黎浪漫之旅

125
00:07:28,410 --> 00:07:33,040
It goes to Emil Alexander with a high bid of $2300.
由艾彌爾亞歷山大 以2千3百元的高價得標

126
00:07:33,210 --> 00:07:35,380
So close!
只差一點

127
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:39,250
Guys,look. Got me some drinks.
你們看，我拿了幾杯酒

128
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:44,420
-What are you doing? -Open bar.
-你在幹什麼？ -不用錢嘛

129
00:07:45,330 --> 00:07:47,820
Well,now it's an empty bar.
你會把人家喝垮

130
00:07:48,630 --> 00:07:52,790
You can't stand anyone else enjoying themselves, can you?
你就是見不得別人開心對吧？

131
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,990
Finally,our biggest item.
最後是今晚的最大項目

132
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:58,700
The 22-foot Gentleman's Daysailer sailboat.
22尺豪華帆船

133
00:07:58,910 --> 00:08:02,570
The winning bid was a whopping $20,000.
得標金額高達2萬元

134
00:08:03,810 --> 00:08:05,400
I won.
我贏了

135
00:08:06,950 --> 00:08:08,880
That was my guess.
那是我猜的

136
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:13,290
-What? What? What? -I guessed $20,000.
-什麼？ -我猜2萬

137
00:08:13,690 --> 00:08:17,590
Joey,it is an auction. You don't guess. You buy!
喬伊，這是拍賣會 你不是猜，是買

138
00:08:18,860 --> 00:08:20,160
What?
什麼？

139
00:08:22,230 --> 00:08:23,660
I don't have $20,000.
我沒有2萬

140
00:08:23,870 --> 00:08:27,730
Congratulations on your new boat, Joey Tribbiani.
恭喜你購得新船… 喬伊崔比亞尼

141
00:08:31,110 --> 00:08:32,600
Joey,sit down.
坐下啦

142
00:08:33,310 --> 00:08:36,070
Forget her. You enjoy this.
別理她，開心就好

143
00:08:53,460 --> 00:08:55,020
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？

144
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:57,360
"One nation...
一個國家

145
00:08:58,270 --> 00:09:02,970
under God,indivisible, with liberty and justice for all."
在神之下 不可分割，全民擁有 自由公正

147
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:06,330
I remembered it. The champagne is here.
我記得是這樣背，香檳來了

148
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:10,010
-You okay? -Yes. I'm good. Are you good?
-你沒事吧？ -我很好，你好嗎？ 

150
00:09:10,210 --> 00:09:12,650
Is everything..? Are you perfect?
這一切…你很好嗎？

151
00:09:13,350 --> 00:09:14,540
Yeah. I'm okay.
還好

152
00:09:14,750 --> 00:09:18,050
Actually,I'm a bit cold. Can I have your jacket?
其實我有點冷 外套可以借我嗎？

154
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:21,320
No, you can't have my jacket.
不行，我的外套不能借你

155
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:24,460
Because then I would be cold.
因為那樣我就會冷

156
00:09:24,860 --> 00:09:29,020
If you thought you'd be cold, you should've brought a jacket.
你要是覺得會冷 應該自己帶外套

157
00:09:30,130 --> 00:09:33,260
But, other than that, are you okay?
除此之外你好嗎？

158
00:09:34,470 --> 00:09:38,840
-Are you sure you're okay? -Yes. I'm fine.
-你真的沒事嗎？ -對，我很好

160
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:44,240
In fact,I've been fine for a long time now and I think...
我這段日子一直都很好 我覺得…

161
00:09:44,450 --> 00:09:46,380
the reason is you.
都是因為有你

162
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:48,310
That's sweet.
好甜蜜喔

164
00:09:52,290 --> 00:09:56,090
Before I met you, I had really little life.
認識你之前 我的人生微不足道

165
00:09:57,660 --> 00:10:01,060
-And I couldn't imagine growing old.. -Oh,my God.
-我無法想像一個人… -我的天哪 

166
00:10:01,260 --> 00:10:03,890
-I know. But let me say it. -Richard.
-我知道，不過讓我說完  -理查

167
00:10:04,230 --> 00:10:06,430
What? I'm Chandler.
什麼？我是錢德

169
00:10:08,700 --> 00:10:10,260
Oh, that's Richard.
那是理查

170
00:10:11,670 --> 00:10:14,470
Maybe he won't see us. Richard!
也許他會沒看見 理查

171
00:10:18,850 --> 00:10:20,810
Monica. Chandler.
摩妮卡，錢德

172
00:10:23,520 --> 00:10:25,610
I don't know why I did that.
我不知道我為什麼要抱你

173
00:10:26,690 --> 00:10:30,020
-Good to see you. -You too. You let your hair grow.
-見到你真好 -彼此彼此，你把頭髮留長了

175
00:10:30,220 --> 00:10:32,950
That's right. You always wanted me to.
沒錯，你一直希望我留長

176
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:37,120
-I see your mustache is back. -Well,my nose got lonely.
-你又開始留鬍子了 -我的鼻子感到寂寞

178
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:40,430
You don't have a mustache, which is good.
你沒留鬍子，很好

179
00:10:42,470 --> 00:10:45,630
Chandler. I make jokes when I'm uncomfortable.
我是錢德，我一蹩扭就開玩笑

180
00:10:46,170 --> 00:10:47,970
-Hi,I'm Lisa. -Hi.
我是麗莎

181
00:10:48,180 --> 00:10:52,910
I'm sorry. Lisa, Monica, Chandler. We used to date.
抱歉，麗莎 摩妮卡，錢德 我們交往過

183
00:10:53,110 --> 00:10:56,680
Richard, no one's supposed to know about us.
理查，我們的事應該保密

184
00:10:58,790 --> 00:11:00,750
See? I did it again.
我又來了

185
00:11:01,860 --> 00:11:04,590
-Chandler,sit down. -I'll sit down.
-錢德，我們坐下吧 -好，我坐

186
00:11:04,790 --> 00:11:07,590
-Good to see you. -Your table's ready,sir.
-很高興見到你  -您的桌子準備好了

188
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:09,320
Good to see you guys.
很高興遇見你們 

189
00:11:09,500 --> 00:11:12,130
If you prefer,this table's available.
這一桌也是空的

190
00:11:13,070 --> 00:11:14,830
That might be fun.
一起坐應該不錯

191
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:25,380
-What were you thinking? -I didn't know it was an auction.
你在想什麼？ 我不知道這是拍賣會

193
00:11:25,580 --> 00:11:30,020
I figured I'd take a guess. Help a charity. Free boat!
我以為是猜一猜 幫助慈善團體，免費得帆船

194
00:11:30,690 --> 00:11:33,350
Why would a charity give away a boat?
慈善團體為什麼要送帆船？

195
00:11:33,550 --> 00:11:36,520
I don't know. Charity?
我哪知，做慈善嗎？

196
00:11:37,430 --> 00:11:39,950
Well,just buy the damn boat.
你就買吧

197
00:11:40,830 --> 00:11:43,700
Don't you think you've had enough to drink?
菲比，你喝得夠多了吧？

198
00:11:43,860 --> 00:11:46,130
I'm just helping the kids.
我只是在幫助兒童

199
00:11:47,300 --> 00:11:49,860
How is you drinking helping the kids?
你喝酒怎麼能幫助兒童？

200
00:11:50,070 --> 00:11:54,800
Because the more I drink, the less there is for the kids to drink.
我喝得越多 孩子們能喝的就越少

201
00:11:58,210 --> 00:12:01,110
Mr. Tribbiani, your contribution brings us...
崔比亞尼先生 你的慷慨解囊 

202
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:04,440
a step closer to building the youth center.
讓興建活動中心的事大有進展

203
00:12:04,650 --> 00:12:08,590
-I'm so happy you brought him. -So am I.
-我很高興你帶他來 -我也是

204
00:12:08,790 --> 00:12:11,820
I'm curious. How much is that boat worth?
我很好奇，那艘船值多少？

205
00:12:12,030 --> 00:12:16,550
-I think it was valued at 19,000. -Hey,I was pretty close.
-差不多是1萬9  -我猜得蠻準的

207
00:12:20,600 --> 00:12:22,590
So,bad news.
壞消息 

208
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:25,930
I can't buy the boat. I don't have any money.
我不能買那艘船，我沒有錢

209
00:12:29,540 --> 00:12:33,310
Joey! Joey, good one. He's silly.
喬伊，你真幽默

210
00:12:34,450 --> 00:12:35,940
Good! Very good!
你真會演

211
00:12:40,620 --> 00:12:44,790
-So I think I'm gonna take off now. -You can't leave,Joey!
-好吧，我要閃了 -你不能走，喬伊

213
00:12:44,990 --> 00:12:48,050
You agreed to buy that boat. It's a contract.
你答應要買船，具有約束力

214
00:12:48,260 --> 00:12:50,990
Plus,if you leave, my boss will kill me.
而且你走了 我的主管會宰了我

215
00:12:51,370 --> 00:12:54,060
I don't have that kind of money.
那怎麼辦？我沒有那麼多錢

216
00:12:54,270 --> 00:12:57,500
I know. Okay,okay. This is what we'll do.
我知道，好 好 這樣吧 

217
00:12:57,710 --> 00:13:01,470
We'll let the next highest bidder buy it.
我們去找出價第二高的人 然後讓他們去買 

219
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:04,040
Then you'll pay the difference.
你只要付差價

220
00:13:04,250 --> 00:13:08,340
Okay. I don't know why the kids need a youth center anyway.
好 這些小孩要活動中心幹嘛

222
00:13:08,550 --> 00:13:13,350
They should just watch TV after school like I did. I turned out fine.
放了學跟我一樣看電視就好了 我現在也蠻好的

224
00:13:14,220 --> 00:13:15,210
Not great.
但是不優秀

225
00:13:18,860 --> 00:13:22,660
I'm helping the kids so much I think I'm gonna throw up.
我幫助貧童幫到想吐

226
00:13:24,500 --> 00:13:26,630
So we're hiding in the bathroom...
我們躲在洗手間裡

227
00:13:26,830 --> 00:13:30,290
I get out. But before she can, her parents come in.
然後我溜出來 但摩妮卡還沒出來 她父母就進去了

229
00:13:30,500 --> 00:13:34,770
I hide in the shower. They start going at it on the floor.
於是我躲到浴簾後面 接著他們就在地上做起來了

230
00:13:34,980 --> 00:13:36,140
Oh, my God!
我的天哪

231
00:13:36,340 --> 00:13:37,640
I got a good one.
我有一個，我有一個

232
00:13:37,810 --> 00:13:42,180
I once walked in on both my parents making love to the same guy.
我有一次撞見我父母 跟同一個男人做愛

233
00:13:48,620 --> 00:13:53,390
It's so great seeing you guys again. I'd like to make a toast.
遇見你們真的好開心 我想敬酒

234
00:13:53,590 --> 00:13:57,120
As a poet once said, "In the sweetness of friendship...
正如一位詩人所說 「在友誼的甜蜜裡」

235
00:13:57,330 --> 00:14:00,630
Let there be laughter and sharing of pleasures.
「盡情歡笑，分享歡樂吧」

236
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:05,700
In the dew of little things, the heart finds its morning and is refreshed."
「人心正是從中獲得朝氣 煥然一新」

237
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:09,770
What?
什麼？

238
00:14:17,750 --> 00:14:19,240
Oh,my God! You guys!
天哪，你們

239
00:14:19,450 --> 00:14:23,480
Have we got a story for you. Guess who we bumped into?
在你開口之前，我們有事要說 猜我們吃飯時遇見誰？ 

240
00:14:23,690 --> 00:14:25,890
-Who? -Richard!
誰？ 理查 

242
00:14:29,160 --> 00:14:32,220
Right, that's Richard's favorite place too.
沒錯，那裡也是理查的最愛

243
00:14:32,430 --> 00:14:37,600
-Oh,you knew that? Good. -Weren't you going out with Elizabeth?
所以你知道？很好 你不是要跟伊麗莎白約會？

245
00:14:37,810 --> 00:14:41,640
I was. She was a little busy with a water balloon fight.
沒錯，但是她忙著打水球仗

246
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:45,800
Sometimes grownups have commitments they can't get out of.
有時大人就是會有事無法脫身

247
00:14:46,550 --> 00:14:49,040
Maybe she is too young for me.
也許她真的太年輕了

248
00:14:49,250 --> 00:14:53,280
When I was over there, I felt like I was a babysitter.
當我看到她跟朋友橫衝直撞 我覺得我好像保姆

249
00:14:53,490 --> 00:14:57,550
I see what you were talking about. I don't know what to do.
我終於開始瞭解你們的話 我不知道該怎麼辦

250
00:14:57,760 --> 00:15:01,420
Weigh the good stuff about her against the bad.
你可以比較這段感情的利弊

252
00:15:01,630 --> 00:15:05,760
That's what I did when I first started... weighing stuff.
我當初就是這樣…比較東西的

254
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:11,570
Okay, bad stuff. I'm 12 years older than she is.
好，弊 我比她大12歲

256
00:15:11,740 --> 00:15:13,760
The school could fire you.
學校發現會開除你

257
00:15:13,970 --> 00:15:16,810
-She's leaving for three months. -For camp.
她要離開3個月 去參加夏令營

258
00:15:18,450 --> 00:15:20,210
Okay, good stuff.
好，利

259
00:15:20,510 --> 00:15:23,510
Well,she's sweet and pretty and..
她很甜很漂亮…

260
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:26,210
And the sex is probably great, huh?
性愛方面很贊吧？

261
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:31,350
It's tender and respectful, if that's what you mean.
如果你是指很溫柔又互相尊重

262
00:15:33,560 --> 00:15:37,460
The only thing you need to ask is, "Do you see a future?"
你只需要問你自己 你看得見未來嗎？

263
00:15:37,970 --> 00:15:40,990
Do you see yourself marrying her?
你能想像跟她結婚嗎？

264
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:44,500
My God. You married her, didn't you?
天哪，你已經娶她了對不對？

265
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:49,870
No, I didn't do that. It's just...
沒有啦，我只是…

266
00:15:50,680 --> 00:15:55,340
Okay, honestly, no. I don't see a big future with her.
好吧，我覺得我們沒什麼未來

267
00:15:56,380 --> 00:15:58,750
Okay, I think that's your answer.
那這就是你的答案了

268
00:15:59,190 --> 00:16:01,850
I gotta talk to her. I hate this part.
我得告訴她 我最恨這個步驟了

269
00:16:02,020 --> 00:16:04,750
Forget Elizabeth. If you're not careful...
你必須忘記伊麗莎白 你要是不小心 

270
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:08,120
you may not get married at all this year.
今年可能會結不到婚

271
00:16:14,740 --> 00:16:19,700
-Weren't you supposed to do something? -Good luck with Elizabeth,my man.
-你今晚不是要做某件事？ -祝分手順利

273
00:16:33,550 --> 00:16:36,390
My God, Phoebe, how many have you had?
天哪，菲比，你喝了幾杯？

274
00:16:36,560 --> 00:16:39,650
1,2,3... Seven times three.. 21!
一，二，三… 七乘以三，二十一杯

275
00:16:41,100 --> 00:16:45,690
-You must be just wasted! -I'm a little tired.
-你一定醉翻了 -是有點累

277
00:16:46,930 --> 00:16:50,730
-Next highest bidder is at table one. -Great.
出價第二高的人在一號桌 太好了

279
00:16:50,940 --> 00:16:54,070
The guy with the Paris trip is at table four.
標到巴黎之旅的人坐四號桌

280
00:16:54,270 --> 00:16:58,680
-Why do you care about who won? -It's a trip for two.
你幹嘛管誰贏得巴黎之旅？ 那是雙人之旅

282
00:16:58,910 --> 00:17:00,380
Excuse me.
失陪

283
00:17:05,850 --> 00:17:09,620
Is the person who won the Paris trip at this table?
抱歉，標到巴黎之旅的人 在這一桌嗎？

284
00:17:09,790 --> 00:17:12,550
-That was me. -Enchante.
我就是 真迷人

286
00:17:16,300 --> 00:17:20,760
-Is there a Mr. Bowmont at this table?  -That's me.
抱歉，有沒有一位波芒先生？ 我就是

287
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:25,160
Well,hello. This is your lucky day, Mr. Bowmont.
你好 你今天走運了，波芒先生

288
00:17:25,710 --> 00:17:29,510
The Gentleman Daysailer has become available again...
那艘帆船又要賣了

289
00:17:29,710 --> 00:17:32,770
and I believe you made a bid of $18,000.
你開了1萬8的價格

290
00:17:32,980 --> 00:17:36,070
You have to pay that. It's not just a guess.
你得付錢，不是猜好玩的

291
00:17:39,220 --> 00:17:43,590
I was relieved I didn't win. My wife would've killed me.
我沒標到船還鬆了一口氣 我老婆會宰了我

292
00:17:43,790 --> 00:17:46,350
You kidding? She'll love this boat!
不會吧？她會愛死這艘船

293
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:48,820
-What is your wife's name? -Pam.
尊夫人芳名？ 她叫潘

296
00:17:51,130 --> 00:17:54,460
Just imagine this: The Pam.
只要想像一下 「潘之號」

298
00:17:56,300 --> 00:17:58,700
I don't think she'd like that.
我想她不會喜歡

299
00:17:58,910 --> 00:18:03,040
Okay. Imagine this: The Mr. Bowmont.
那想像…「波芒先生號」

300
00:18:03,910 --> 00:18:07,470
-I don't think so. -Let me paint you a little picture.
還是不要了 讓我為你描繪一下

302
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:12,680
You are setting sail up the Hudson. You've got the wind in your... arms.
你在哈德遜河上航行 風吹過你的頭…雙手

304
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:18,760
You get all that peace and quiet you've always wanted.
你得到你企盼已久的安寧

305
00:18:18,930 --> 00:18:21,950
You get back to nature. You can go fishing.
你回到大自然懷抱 你可以釣魚

306
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:26,000
You get one of those hats. People call you captain.
你可以買一頂帽子 讓大家叫你船長

307
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:28,760
And then when you're old, Cappy.
等你老了就是老船長

308
00:18:30,540 --> 00:18:34,700
-It's for a good cause. All right. -No way! It's mine!
-管他的，不買說不過去 我買了 -你別想，船是我的

310
00:18:34,980 --> 00:18:35,960
What?
什麼？

311
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:42,740
-The stuff you said,I want that! -But you don't have $20,000!
-你剛才說的那些事我也要 -但是喬伊，你沒有2萬

314
00:18:42,950 --> 00:18:46,610
Who cares? I'll make payments! I want the Mr. Bowmont!
管他的，我分期，怎樣都好 我要「波芒先生號」

315
00:18:52,860 --> 00:18:57,350
-Oh,my God. You're back. -Let me see it. Let me see your hand.
-天哪，你們回來了 -讓我看你的手，讓我看你的手

317
00:18:57,560 --> 00:18:59,460
Why do you wanna see my hand?
你為什麼要看我的手？

318
00:18:59,670 --> 00:19:03,530
I wanna see what's in your hand. I wanna see the trash.
我想看你手上拿的垃圾

319
00:19:05,470 --> 00:19:09,170
It's all dirty. You should throw this out.
好髒，你最好拿去扔

321
00:19:14,250 --> 00:19:16,770
-What did you just do? -What happened?
你們搞什麼？ 怎麼回事？

322
00:19:16,980 --> 00:19:20,390
-Richard was there. I couldn't do it. -Oh,no.
理查也在，我無法開口 不會吧

325
00:19:20,590 --> 00:19:23,420
I was gonna surprise her tomorrow.
我要延到明天，給她驚喜 

326
00:19:23,620 --> 00:19:25,890
-Now you've ruined it. -We didn't.
卻被你們破壞了 我們沒有

327
00:19:26,090 --> 00:19:29,760
Who walks in a room and asks to see a person's hands?
誰會一進門就要看別人的手？

329
00:19:30,160 --> 00:19:34,530
A palm reader, a manicurist, a hand doctor...
算命師、修指甲的小姐 手部醫生…

330
00:19:34,740 --> 00:19:37,530
-Glove salesman. -Good one!
手套推銷員 漂亮

331
00:19:39,710 --> 00:19:42,040
This is terrible. What will I do?
真慘，我該怎麼辦？

332
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:46,610
She only suspects something. So just throw her off the track.
她只是在懷疑，又不是確定 你可以唬她

333
00:19:46,810 --> 00:19:50,270
I'll pretend marriage is the last thing on my mind.
也對，我可以讓她覺得 我完全不考慮結婚

334
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:55,050
Yeah! Convince her you're scared of commitment, that you're a coward.
沒錯，讓她相信你很害怕承諾 讓她相信你有點孬種

336
00:19:55,290 --> 00:19:58,190
I can do that. I've had years of practice.
我做得到，我練了30年

337
00:19:58,390 --> 00:20:01,450
Being you is finally gonna pay off!
你這個人總算有價值了

338
00:20:03,260 --> 00:20:08,290
Some idiot keeps stuffing the trash chute with pizza boxes.
某個白癡小孩老是用披薩盒 把垃圾槽堵住

340
00:20:08,940 --> 00:20:11,460
That guy is still doing that?
那個傢伙還是沒改？

341
00:20:13,270 --> 00:20:15,870
Oh,my God. Let me see your hand!
天哪，你們回來了 我看看你的手

342
00:20:16,080 --> 00:20:19,600
You're too late! She already took out the trash!
來不及了 她已經把垃圾拿去扔了

343
00:20:38,370 --> 00:20:40,770
Look,Elizabeth, we have to talk.
伊麗莎白，我們得談一談

344
00:20:48,810 --> 00:20:53,010
I have never had such a healthy breakup.
我跟別人分手沒這麼平和過

345
00:20:53,280 --> 00:20:56,550
She was such a grownup about it.
她表現得好成熟

346
00:20:56,880 --> 00:21:00,410
She didn't seem too immature for me.
我覺得她一點也不幼稚

347
00:21:00,790 --> 00:21:04,090
Did I just make a huge mistake?
我是不是犯了個大錯？

348
00:21:04,320 --> 00:21:05,810
Ross! Wait!
羅斯，等等

349
00:21:06,130 --> 00:21:09,490
Elizabeth, thank God. I was just thinking about..
伊麗莎白，太好了 我正在想說…

350
00:21:09,700 --> 00:21:10,750
You suck!
你最爛了

351
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:12,990
What?
什麼？

353
00:21:20,910 --> 00:21:23,270
Breakup's still on.
好，分手還是有效

354
00:21:33,690 --> 00:21:37,650
Here she comes. Do I look like I don't wanna get married?
她來了 我像不像不想結婚的人？

355
00:21:39,390 --> 00:21:42,120
And, also, a little like a French guy.
像，還有點像法國人

356
00:21:45,430 --> 00:21:47,630
I never noticed that before.
我第一次發現

357
00:21:50,940 --> 00:21:55,640
-What are you up to? -Hanging out. Talking about websites.
你們在幹什麼？ 只是在殺時間，聊網站

359
00:21:57,480 --> 00:22:00,610
We saw this interesting website about marriage...
有一個網站在討論婚姻...

360
00:22:00,810 --> 00:22:05,950
and how unnecessary it is, a way for the government to keep tabs.
及婚姻的一無是處 說那只是政府監視你的方式

362
00:22:06,150 --> 00:22:07,750
Yeah, Big Brother.
是啊，專制

363
00:22:09,160 --> 00:22:10,490
That's a bit crazy.
有點誇張

364
00:22:10,690 --> 00:22:15,390
Although I am glad you're looking at other things on the lnternet.
不過你們總算上了 其他類別的網站

365
00:22:15,930 --> 00:22:20,530
Got me thinking. Why would anybody want to get married?
不過我就想 為什麼會有人想要結婚？

366
00:22:20,700 --> 00:22:24,400
To celebrate the relationship, solidify the commitment...
為什麼？因為要讚頌這段感情 要鞏固你們的承諾

367
00:22:24,600 --> 00:22:27,870
declare your love for one another to the world.
要向全世界宣佈你們的愛

368
00:22:31,140 --> 00:22:33,080
Well,that's good to know.
能知道你的反應真好

369
00:22:35,720 --> 00:22:38,010
The Mr. Bowmont is here!
「波芒先生號」來了

370
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:47,450
A diner wants to compliment you. Shall I let him in?
有一位客人想向主廚致意 要讓他進來嗎？

371
00:22:47,630 --> 00:22:50,120
Sure. I love this part.
當然，我最愛這種事了

373
00:22:50,600 --> 00:22:53,070
-Come on in. -Hi.
進來吧

374
00:22:53,930 --> 00:22:57,630
-Richard. -I'm not here to compliment the chef.
理查  其實我不是來向主廚致意的

376
00:22:57,900 --> 00:23:01,500
I hate when people come back to compliment the chef.
沒關係 我最討厭客人跑來致意

377
00:23:01,710 --> 00:23:04,200
Like I have nothing better to do.
好像我很閒似的

378
00:23:05,350 --> 00:23:06,440
So,what's up?
你有什麼事？

379
00:23:06,610 --> 00:23:09,480
It was great seeing you the other night.
那天晚上遇見你很開心

380
00:23:09,680 --> 00:23:11,510
Good to see you too.
我也很開心

381
00:23:13,150 --> 00:23:18,460
-You came to tell me that? -I came to tell you something else.
你就是來說這個的？ 不是，我是來說別的

383
00:23:20,090 --> 00:23:23,820
I came here to tell you I still love you.
我是來說我仍然愛你

384
00:23:26,430 --> 00:23:28,730
What? What did you..? What?
什麼？你剛才…什麼？

385
00:23:30,740 --> 00:23:32,430
I still love you.
我仍然愛你

386
00:23:32,640 --> 00:23:36,100
I know I shouldn't even be here telling you this.
我知道我甚至不該告訴你

387
00:23:36,310 --> 00:23:38,710
You're with Chandler, who I like.
你跟錢德在一起，我很喜歡他

388
00:23:38,910 --> 00:23:41,640
If you say he's straight, I'll believe you.
你說他是異性戀，我就相信你

389
00:23:42,650 --> 00:23:46,880
After seeing you, I knew if I didn't tell you I'd regret it.
但見到你之後 我知道我不說會後悔一輩子

390
00:23:47,090 --> 00:23:50,610
Letting you go was the stupidest thing I ever did.
放棄你是我所做過最蠢的事

391
00:23:51,220 --> 00:23:54,250
You're really not supposed to be back here.
你不該到廚房來的

392
00:23:54,530 --> 00:23:59,160
I'm sorry. I know this is the wrong time and the wrong place...
對不起, 我知道時機地點都不對...

394
00:23:59,370 --> 00:24:01,390
but I had to tell you.
但是我一定要說

395
00:24:01,740 --> 00:24:05,260
I wanna spend my life with you. I wanna marry you.
我想跟你共度一生，我想娶你

396
00:24:06,310 --> 00:24:08,540
I wanna have kids with you.
我想跟你生兒育女

397
00:24:10,980 --> 00:24:14,410
Oh,my God. Why don't they put chairs back here?
這裡為什麼沒擺椅子？

398
00:24:15,580 --> 00:24:19,040
Look,I know this is crazy, but am I too late?
我知道我很扯 已經來不及了嗎？

399
00:24:19,450 --> 00:24:23,050
You're too late. Where was all this three years ago?
沒錯 你3年前怎麼不說這些話？

400
00:24:23,220 --> 00:24:25,660
I know. I was an idiot.
我知道，我是個白癡

401
00:24:25,860 --> 00:24:28,330
I tried to forget you. I really did.
我也想忘記你，真的

402
00:24:28,530 --> 00:24:33,230
After our last lunch, I spent six months in Africa trying to forget.
我們去年吃完飯 我跑去非洲6個月想忘記你

404
00:24:33,630 --> 00:24:36,900
-What did you do there? -Work with blind kids.
你去非洲做什麼？ 幫助盲童

405
00:24:37,100 --> 00:24:39,590
What are you doing to me?
你折磨我嘛

406
00:24:40,110 --> 00:24:41,630
Look,I...

407
00:24:41,980 --> 00:24:45,100
I'm sorry, but this is not gonna happen.
很抱歉，我們之間是不可能的

408
00:24:45,310 --> 00:24:49,210
That's fine. I'll walk away. I'll never bother you again.
好，我會離開 再也不會來煩你

409
00:24:49,420 --> 00:24:53,820
Only if you say Chandler's willing to give you everything I am.
但前提是 錢德也願意給你這一切

410
00:24:54,020 --> 00:24:56,420
Well,he is. I mean...
他願意

411
00:24:56,660 --> 00:25:00,150
marriage is all he talks about. My goodness!
沒錯，他成天把婚姻掛在嘴邊

412
00:25:00,360 --> 00:25:03,190
In fact, I'm the one making him wait.
事實上是我在讓他等

413
00:25:03,460 --> 00:25:05,190
You are? Why?
是嗎？ 對

414
00:25:05,400 --> 00:25:06,800
Why?
為什麼？

415
00:25:07,770 --> 00:25:09,740
Because of the government.
因為政府的陰謀

416
00:25:13,640 --> 00:25:16,170
Isn't it incredible?
很棒吧？ 

417
00:25:16,380 --> 00:25:19,400
Monica and Chandler are getting married.
摩妮卡和錢德要結婚了

418
00:25:19,610 --> 00:25:22,610
I know. They'll be so happy together.
就是啊，他們會很幸福

419
00:25:22,880 --> 00:25:25,780
How often do two best friends fall in love?
兩個最要好的朋友墜入愛河 這種機率有多大？

420
00:25:25,990 --> 00:25:28,050
-Not that often. -No.
並不太大 沒錯

421
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:33,190
-I'm so happy for them. -Me too. So happy for them.
我好替他們開心 我也是，好開心

423
00:25:33,790 --> 00:25:36,280
I'm so happy and not at all jealous.
我很高興，毫無嫉妒之心

424
00:25:36,830 --> 00:25:40,560
Oh,no! God, definitely not jealous.
沒錯，當然沒有

425
00:25:45,310 --> 00:25:49,500
I'm probably 98% happy and maybe 2% jealous.
我可能是98%開心 2%嫉妒

426
00:25:49,710 --> 00:25:52,970
-I mean,what's 2%? That's nothing. -Totally.
2%等於沒有 沒錯

427
00:25:55,680 --> 00:25:58,120
-I'm like 90/10. -Yeah. Me too.
我是九比一 我也是

428
00:26:05,490 --> 00:26:07,620
Have you guys seen Chandler?
你們有見到錢德嗎？

429
00:26:10,460 --> 00:26:13,360
No. But you know who was looking for you?
沒有，但你知道誰來找過你？

430
00:26:13,570 --> 00:26:15,190
Tennille.
坦妮爾 （「船長與坦妮爾」為樂團）

431
00:26:23,840 --> 00:26:28,340
The marriage stuff you were saying yesterday? You don't believe that.
你昨天說的那些話 應該不是真心話吧？

432
00:26:28,520 --> 00:26:33,850
Sure,I do. In fact,I think the concept of marriage is unnatural.
當然是 事實上我覺得婚姻本身 就很不近人情

434
00:26:34,050 --> 00:26:38,120
Look at pigs. Let's take a second here and look at pigs.
你看豬嘛，我們來看一下豬

435
00:26:38,330 --> 00:26:40,120
Pigs don't mate for life.
豬不會有固定配偶

436
00:26:40,330 --> 00:26:43,960
A pig can have 100 sexual partners in a lifetime.
豬的一生可以有一百個性伴侶

437
00:26:44,160 --> 00:26:48,330
That's an ordinary pig, not even a pig that's good at sports.
那還只是普通的豬 而不是擅長運動的豬

438
00:26:51,040 --> 00:26:53,670
Yeah, but that's pigs, not people.
對，但那是豬不是人

439
00:26:53,870 --> 00:26:58,440
If marriage worked,I'd be for it. Do you know the divorce rate?
如果結婚行得通，我絕對支持 但是你知道美國的離婚率嗎？

440
00:26:58,650 --> 00:27:00,170
Ninety-seven percent!
97%

441
00:27:01,650 --> 00:27:02,840
Wait a minute.
等一下

442
00:27:03,920 --> 00:27:07,680
Are you telling me you may never want to get married?
你是說你可能永遠都不想結婚

443
00:27:07,890 --> 00:27:11,380
-Who's to say? -You! You are to say!
誰曉得？ 你啊，你曉得

444
00:27:11,590 --> 00:27:14,220
Never say never, but, probably...
話不能說死，不過應該是…

445
00:27:14,430 --> 00:27:15,720
yeah, never.
永遠不會

446
00:27:16,860 --> 00:27:21,060
Oh,my God. Then what are we even doing? What is this?
天哪，那我們在幹什麼？ 現在算什麼？

447
00:27:21,270 --> 00:27:24,700
Whoa,whoa,whoa! What is all this pressure?
幹嘛對我施壓？

448
00:27:25,170 --> 00:27:27,070
Is this some new strategy?
這是某種新策略嗎？

449
00:27:27,270 --> 00:27:31,470
Why don't you put down your copy of The Rules, huh, mantrap?
你別再搞爾虞我詐那一套了

450
00:27:32,480 --> 00:27:34,500
You know what? I gotta go.
你知道嗎？我要走了

451
00:27:36,780 --> 00:27:39,270
It's okay. I got a plan.
放心，我自有打算

452
00:27:44,960 --> 00:27:47,590
-We're gonna find love. -Definitely.
我們會找到真愛的 一定會的

453
00:27:49,100 --> 00:27:51,760
Yeah,I'm pretty confident about that.
我對這點有信心

454
00:27:52,200 --> 00:27:56,790
That's what makes it so easy to be 80% happy for Monica and Chandler.
所以我可以有八成 替摩妮卡和錢德高興

455
00:27:57,700 --> 00:28:00,730
-A guarantee would be nice. -What do you mean?
不過要是有保障就好了 什麼意思？

456
00:28:00,910 --> 00:28:03,400
Some friends make a deal.
有些人不是會跟朋友約定

458
00:28:03,610 --> 00:28:08,140
Like if neither of them are married by 40, they marry each other.
要是兩個人到了40都沒結婚 他們就要結婚

459
00:28:08,350 --> 00:28:10,040
-A backup? -Exactly.
你是指備胎？ 沒錯

460
00:28:10,250 --> 00:28:11,980
Yeah, I've got that.
我已經找好了

461
00:28:13,490 --> 00:28:14,950
You do?
你找好了？

462
00:28:15,160 --> 00:28:16,450
-Who? -Joey.
是誰？ 喬伊

463
00:28:16,620 --> 00:28:21,460
-Joey? Are you serious? -I locked him in years ago.
喬伊？真的還假的？ 我好幾年前就鎖定他了

465
00:28:24,700 --> 00:28:29,730
Wait. So if neither of you are married by 40, you'll marry Joey?
所以要是你們40歲還沒結婚 你就要嫁給喬伊

466
00:28:29,940 --> 00:28:31,870
Yep. We shook on it.
對，我們握手為定

468
00:28:32,240 --> 00:28:36,330
But believe me, that is not how he wanted to seal the deal.
不過他可不想就此打住

469
00:28:37,440 --> 00:28:39,040
Oh, seriously?
是嗎？

470
00:28:39,250 --> 00:28:41,540
I think his exact words were..
對，他說的是…

471
00:28:44,250 --> 00:28:45,240
Charming.
真迷人

472
00:28:46,120 --> 00:28:48,090
He's just a backup.
只是個備胎

473
00:28:56,330 --> 00:29:00,030
-Hey,Monica. -Have you seen Rachel? Or a mirror?
-摩妮卡 -你有見到瑞秋嗎？或是鏡子？

475
00:29:01,500 --> 00:29:05,340
-It's for my boat. Pretty cool,huh? -Yeah,it's great.
-這是我的船長裝，酷吧？ -很酷

476
00:29:05,540 --> 00:29:08,060
What's wrong? Talk to the captain.
怎麼了？告訴船長

478
00:29:10,040 --> 00:29:13,480
Just realizing I'm in a dead-end relationship.
我又發現這段感情是死路一條

479
00:29:13,680 --> 00:29:17,580
-Chandler being difficult? -I don't want marriage tomorrow.
錢德欺負你是吧？ 我又不是明天就要結婚

481
00:29:17,780 --> 00:29:22,240
But I wanna know we're going somewhere, that I'm not wasting time.
我只是想知道 我不是在原地打轉，浪費時間

482
00:29:22,420 --> 00:29:25,480
-You know Chandler. -No,I don't know Chandler.
你也瞭解錢德  我已經不瞭解錢德了

484
00:29:25,690 --> 00:29:29,920
Not anymore. It's like something's changed.
彷彿有什麼事變了

485
00:29:30,300 --> 00:29:33,660
-Maybe you changed. -I didn't change.
也許是你變了？ 我才沒變

487
00:29:34,100 --> 00:29:35,830
Maybe that's the problem.
也許問題就在這裡

488
00:29:37,540 --> 00:29:40,400
-What? -Chandler is a complex fellow.
什麼？ 錢德很複雜

490
00:29:40,610 --> 00:29:43,300
One who is unlikely to take a wife.
不太可能成親

491
00:29:45,450 --> 00:29:47,880
Is that some kind of boat talk?
這是跑船人的用語嗎？

492
00:29:48,310 --> 00:29:52,050
I haven't totally decided how to talk on my boat yet.
我還沒想好在船上的說話風格

493
00:29:54,290 --> 00:29:57,450
Does he think I'll wait around for nothing?
他以為我會空等下去嗎？

494
00:29:57,660 --> 00:30:00,820
Face it. Chandler is against marriage.
面對現實吧，錢德反對婚姻 

495
00:30:01,030 --> 00:30:02,890
And always will be.
他是不會變了

496
00:30:04,130 --> 00:30:07,030
There's some people who do wanna marry me.
有些人可是真心想娶我

497
00:30:07,230 --> 00:30:09,530
-There are? -Yeah. Richard.
有嗎？ 有，理查

499
00:30:10,040 --> 00:30:12,900
Richard said he wants to marry you?
理查說他想娶你？

500
00:30:13,610 --> 00:30:17,410
-And Chandler says he hates marriage? -That's right.
錢德說他痛恨婚姻？ 沒錯

501
00:30:17,610 --> 00:30:19,480
Chandler loves marriage!
錢德熱愛婚姻

502
00:30:21,650 --> 00:30:23,880
You just said he hates marriage!
你剛才說他痛恨婚姻

503
00:30:24,080 --> 00:30:27,640
"He's a complex fellow who's unlikely to take a wife"!
說他很複雜，不太可能娶妻

504
00:30:27,850 --> 00:30:30,980
"He's against marriage and always will be"!
說他會永遠反對婚姻

505
00:30:31,190 --> 00:30:33,630
You got that from what I said?
你的解讀是這樣？

506
00:30:39,430 --> 00:30:42,960
After the Cretaceous Period, the dinosaurs were gone.
白堊紀結束，恐龍也從此絕跡

507
00:30:43,170 --> 00:30:46,000
What happened,you guys?
你們究竟怎麼了？

508
00:30:53,080 --> 00:30:55,510
-Rach. -Hey,you.
瑞秋 帥哥

509
00:30:57,150 --> 00:30:58,780
-Come on in. -Thank you.
請進 謝謝

510
00:30:59,250 --> 00:31:02,310
I'm so sorry to hear about you and Elizabeth.
很遺憾你跟伊麗莎白分手了

511
00:31:02,520 --> 00:31:06,620
Thanks. I really thought we'd be able to make it work.
謝謝，我以為我們能克服萬難 

512
00:31:06,830 --> 00:31:08,990
I guess it wasn't meant to be.
這大概是命中注定的

513
00:31:09,200 --> 00:31:13,600
Yeah. Love. It's a tricky business,isn't it?
是啊，愛情…愛情真是微妙

514
00:31:15,000 --> 00:31:18,660
-I guess so. -So,what do you say we make a pact?
是啊  我們要不要來做個約定

516
00:31:18,870 --> 00:31:22,330
If you and I are both single by 40, we get married.
要是我們到了40都還沒結婚 我們就結婚

517
00:31:22,540 --> 00:31:25,740
I mean,we know each other, we like each other...
我們互相認識，互相喜歡

518
00:31:25,950 --> 00:31:29,970
we've already slept together, so there'll be no surprises.
我們已經上過床，不會有意外

519
00:31:30,180 --> 00:31:31,910
No, like, "What's that?"
不會覺得「搞什麼？」

520
00:31:35,360 --> 00:31:39,490
-Oh,you want me to be your backup. -Exactly.
你想找我當備胎？ 沒錯

521
00:31:39,690 --> 00:31:41,820
Yeah. I already have one.
我已經有備胎了

522
00:31:43,160 --> 00:31:44,650
-What? Who? -Phoebe.
是誰？ 菲比

523
00:31:44,860 --> 00:31:46,390
Phoebe?
菲比？

524
00:31:46,900 --> 00:31:49,770
But she just said Joey is her backup.
但是她說喬伊是她的備胎

525
00:31:49,970 --> 00:31:52,130
Oh,I don't think so.
才不是呢

526
00:31:52,840 --> 00:31:56,830
We just spoke. She said that she and Joey made a deal.
羅斯，我剛跟她聊過 她說她和喬伊約好了

527
00:31:57,040 --> 00:32:01,480
That's impossible. We have had a deal for years. We shook on it.
不可能的，我們早就約好了 還握手為定

528
00:32:01,680 --> 00:32:05,880
Although, believe me, she wanted to do a lot more than that.
只不過她覺得握手還不夠…

529
00:32:07,950 --> 00:32:10,920
Gunther, it's Joey. Is Chandler there?
阿甘，我是喬伊，錢德在嗎？

530
00:32:11,590 --> 00:32:15,530
Listen. What kind of muffins do they serve at sea?
我問你，跑船都吃哪一種鬆糕

531
00:32:18,030 --> 00:32:20,330
Where the hell have you been?!
你上哪去了？

532
00:32:20,530 --> 00:32:24,160
I was making a coconut phone with the Professor.
我在跟教授做椰子電話

533
00:32:25,310 --> 00:32:28,500
Richard told Monica he wants to marry her.
理查跟摩妮卡說他想娶她

534
00:32:28,680 --> 00:32:32,300
-What? -I've been trying to find you.
什麼？ 就是啊，我一直想去找你 叫你別玩了

536
00:32:32,510 --> 00:32:37,070
And I would have if these damn boat shoes wouldn't keep flying off!
可是這雙鞋子跑一跑就掉

537
00:32:37,280 --> 00:32:39,770
-Oh,my God! -I know! They suck!
我的天哪  就是啊，爛死了

538
00:32:39,990 --> 00:32:43,250
He's not supposed to ask her to marry him! I am!
他不該向我的女朋友求婚 該求婚的人是我

539
00:32:43,460 --> 00:32:44,750
-I know! -What..?
我知道 那…

540
00:32:44,960 --> 00:32:49,050
You know what I'll do? I'll go over there and kick his ass!
你知道嗎？我要去找他教訓他

541
00:32:49,260 --> 00:32:50,630
Will you help me?
你願意幫忙嗎？

542
00:32:52,370 --> 00:32:57,530
Look, I don't think us getting our asses kicked is a solution, okay?
錢德，被他海扁一頓不是辦法

543
00:32:57,740 --> 00:33:01,170
-Look,just go and find Monica. -You're right.
趕快去找摩妮卡吧  你說得對

544
00:33:01,370 --> 00:33:03,740
Okay. I'm gonna get the ring...
好 我去拿戒指...

546
00:33:03,940 --> 00:33:07,040
I'm gonna go find her and I'm gonna propose!
我要找到她，直接向她求婚

547
00:33:08,510 --> 00:33:10,040
Dude! Dude! Dude!
老兄 怎樣？

549
00:33:10,220 --> 00:33:13,580
That coconut phone might be good for the boat.
你的椰子電話 也許很適合擺在船上

550
00:33:28,170 --> 00:33:29,430
Hi.

551
00:33:31,970 --> 00:33:33,270
Hi.

552
00:33:35,940 --> 00:33:37,810
I don't know why I'm here.
我不知道我來幹什麼

553
00:33:38,440 --> 00:33:40,040
I didn't ask.
我又沒問

554
00:33:42,450 --> 00:33:45,710
-You wanna come in? -I don't know.
你要進來嗎？ 我不知道

555
00:33:46,490 --> 00:33:48,220
Oh,okay.
好吧

556
00:33:48,860 --> 00:33:52,520
I'll just leave the door open and sit on the couch.
那我把門開著，回去坐下

557
00:33:54,490 --> 00:33:57,860
-Chandler is such an idiot! -Drink?
錢德真是個白癡  喝酒？

559
00:33:59,130 --> 00:34:02,160
-Scotch on the.. -Rocks with a twist?
好，我要威士忌加… 冰塊和萊姆片？

560
00:34:02,370 --> 00:34:03,890
I remember.
我記得

561
00:34:06,740 --> 00:34:08,870
You still smoking cigars?
還在抽雪茄？

562
00:34:09,740 --> 00:34:12,210
No, no. That's art.
沒有，那是藝術

563
00:34:13,910 --> 00:34:16,940
If it bothers you, I can put my art out.
如果你不喜歡 我可以把藝術熄掉

564
00:34:17,680 --> 00:34:19,650
No,that's okay.
沒關係

565
00:34:22,020 --> 00:34:25,650
So, Monica, let me ask you a question.
摩妮卡，我問你一件事

566
00:34:25,860 --> 00:34:28,790
Since we broke up, do you ever...
我們分手後，你有...

567
00:34:29,000 --> 00:34:30,620
think about me?
想過我嗎？

568
00:34:31,400 --> 00:34:34,460
Actually,I thought about you a few months ago.
我2個月前還想到你

569
00:34:34,630 --> 00:34:36,600
-Really? -But it's because...
是嗎？ 不過是因為...

570
00:34:36,800 --> 00:34:40,530
I had an eye exam, and I don't like my new eye doctor.
我去做眼睛檢查 又不喜歡我的新醫生

571
00:34:41,670 --> 00:34:43,300
-Who is it? -Edward Nevsky.
是誰？ 愛德華奈夫斯基

572
00:34:43,640 --> 00:34:44,940
He's no good.
他的確很差

573
00:34:47,010 --> 00:34:50,180
Do you ever think about me...
你有想過...

574
00:34:51,020 --> 00:34:54,110
-in a non-eye-doctor way? -No.
非眼科醫生的我嗎？ 沒有

576
00:34:58,420 --> 00:35:02,660
Because getting over you was the hardest thing I've ever done.
但忘記你是我這輩子最難的事

577
00:35:03,130 --> 00:35:06,000
I never let myself think about you.
我不讓自己想到你

578
00:35:06,530 --> 00:35:08,090
Wow.

579
00:35:13,070 --> 00:35:16,010
Phoebe, you picked Joey and Ross?
菲比 你找了喬伊和羅斯？

581
00:35:16,210 --> 00:35:20,040
-You can't have two backups! -Of course I can.
你不能有兩個備胎 當然可以

583
00:35:20,250 --> 00:35:23,110
It's good sense to back up your backup.
眼光獨到才會替備胎找備胎

584
00:35:23,320 --> 00:35:25,940
-Look, I've already lost Chandler. -What?
我已經折損錢德了 什麼？

585
00:35:26,850 --> 00:35:29,620
Hey, Phoebe! We're both your backup?
菲比，我們都是你的備胎？

586
00:35:29,820 --> 00:35:32,520
How could you do this to me?
菲比，你怎麼可以這樣？

587
00:35:33,030 --> 00:35:37,430
Why are you complaining? You were both aware of the situation.
我不知道你們在抱怨什麼 你們都知道這個狀況

588
00:35:37,600 --> 00:35:39,530
-I was not! -No,we weren't!
我們不知道 我不知道

589
00:35:39,730 --> 00:35:43,360
This kind of backtalk won't fly when we're married.
婚後你們可不能這樣頂嘴

590
00:35:44,200 --> 00:35:46,570
You can't have both. Pick one.
菲比，你不能獨佔他們 你得選一個

591
00:35:46,770 --> 00:35:48,300
-Pick me! -No,pick me!
選我 不，選我

592
00:35:48,510 --> 00:35:53,470
-I don't wanna end up an old maid. -All right. Well,let's see.
-我不想當老處女  -好吧，我看看

594
00:35:53,680 --> 00:35:56,010
Ross is a good father.
羅斯是個好爸爸

595
00:35:56,450 --> 00:35:57,540
But...
但是...

596
00:35:57,750 --> 00:36:00,080
Joey has a boat. This is hard.
喬伊有船，好難選喔

597
00:36:00,290 --> 00:36:03,020
This is crazy. I wanna switch to Rachel.
太扯了，我要換成瑞秋

598
00:36:03,290 --> 00:36:06,880
-I wanna switch to Rachel too. -No,wait. Just wait.
我也要換成瑞秋  不，等一下

600
00:36:07,060 --> 00:36:10,220
Wait,guys. Don't make any rash decisions.
你們別急著做決定

601
00:36:10,430 --> 00:36:12,420
Just remember my promise:
記得我的承諾吧？

602
00:36:12,630 --> 00:36:15,660
If we get married,three times a week.
結婚之後 1星期三次

603
00:36:15,870 --> 00:36:17,430
Oh,my God. Phoebe...
天哪，菲比 

604
00:36:17,640 --> 00:36:20,070
I'm talking about massages.
我是說按摩

605
00:36:20,310 --> 00:36:22,430
No,I'm not.

606
00:36:25,550 --> 00:36:28,510
I know how to settle it. We'll do this.
我知道該怎麼解決了 辦法就是

607
00:36:28,710 --> 00:36:32,210
I'm gonna write "Joey" on one napkin...
我在一張紙巾上寫喬伊 

608
00:36:32,420 --> 00:36:37,220
and "Ross" on the other napkin and we're gonna pick one.
一張紙巾上寫羅斯 然後我們一人抽一張

610
00:36:37,420 --> 00:36:40,220
That person will be our backup. Okay?
那個人就是我們的備胎  好嗎？

611
00:36:40,430 --> 00:36:42,020
-Sounds fair. -All right.
很公平 那好

613
00:36:42,230 --> 00:36:44,530
Good. Switching them up.
好，我來弄亂

614
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:49,870
-Pick one. -Left.
選一邊 左邊

615
00:36:50,700 --> 00:36:52,830
-Thank you. -You're welcome.
謝謝 不客氣

616
00:36:55,040 --> 00:36:57,510
-Ross. -Joey.
羅斯 喬伊

617
00:36:59,550 --> 00:37:01,810
-We should switch. -Absolutely.
我們交換好了 沒錯

618
00:37:05,750 --> 00:37:09,150
I missed you, you ugly flat-faced old freak.
我想念你 丑不啦嘰的扁臉老怪物

619
00:37:12,330 --> 00:37:13,880
Excuse me?
你說什麼？

620
00:37:15,330 --> 00:37:16,560
Him.
他啦

621
00:37:20,130 --> 00:37:24,570
I missed this apartment. Now, this is a grownup's apartment.
我想念這間房子 這才是大人的房子

622
00:37:24,770 --> 00:37:27,260
I should be with a grownup, you know?
我應該跟大人在一起，你懂吧

623
00:37:27,610 --> 00:37:31,770
You're saying you need to be with someone more mature.
你是說 你要跟比較成熟的人在一起

625
00:37:32,450 --> 00:37:34,570
Maybe someone with...
也許是一個…

626
00:37:34,980 --> 00:37:37,610
a license to practice medicine.
有醫師執照的人

627
00:37:37,950 --> 00:37:39,710
Or a mustache.
或是有鬍子的人

628
00:37:41,020 --> 00:37:43,680
Let's face it. I'm not a kid anymore.
說真的，我不是小孩子了

629
00:37:43,890 --> 00:37:46,820
I need someone who wants the same things.
我需要一個目標相同的人

630
00:37:47,030 --> 00:37:51,490
Coming to my work and telling me you love me, I want that!
來我工作的地方跟我示愛 我要的是那樣

631
00:37:52,030 --> 00:37:55,830
Talking about pig sex over lunch, I don't want that!
吃飯時聊豬的性愛 我不要那樣

632
00:37:57,070 --> 00:37:58,700
I think that's fair.
很公平

633
00:37:58,900 --> 00:38:01,840
Fair? Please, don't even talk to me about fair.
公平？別跟我提公平

634
00:38:02,040 --> 00:38:05,410
Fair would've been you wanting to marry me then.
公平的意思是你當年想娶我

635
00:38:05,610 --> 00:38:08,080
Or Chandler wanting to marry me now.
或是錢德現在想娶我

636
00:38:08,280 --> 00:38:11,440
Believe me,nothing about this is fair. Nothing.
這整件事一點也不公平

637
00:38:11,620 --> 00:38:14,350
-Nothing! Nothing! -It's okay.
不公平不公平不公平… 別激動

638
00:38:18,820 --> 00:38:20,220
Nothing.
不公平

639
00:38:25,160 --> 00:38:26,360
I don't know.
我不知道

640
00:38:26,570 --> 00:38:28,190
I don't know.
我不知道

641
00:38:29,970 --> 00:38:31,300
I know.
我知道

643
00:38:34,840 --> 00:38:37,210
I have to figure some..
我得先...

644
00:38:37,410 --> 00:38:40,070
Some stuff,before I can...
把事情想清楚 然後才能…

645
00:38:40,350 --> 00:38:41,810
I understand.
我懂

646
00:38:43,020 --> 00:38:45,350
Take as much time as you want.
你只管慢慢想

647
00:38:46,090 --> 00:38:48,880
Ten, even 20 minutes, if you need it.
10分鐘、20分鐘都行

648
00:38:49,820 --> 00:38:52,590
I'll be here. Not smoking.
我會在這裡，不會抽煙

649
00:39:09,380 --> 00:39:10,870
Where is she?
她人呢？

651
00:39:11,110 --> 00:39:13,080
I'm not scared of you.
我可不怕你

652
00:39:14,850 --> 00:39:17,580
She's not here. And please come in.
她不在，請進

653
00:39:18,850 --> 00:39:20,280
Scotch on the rocks...
威士忌加冰和萊姆片 

654
00:39:20,490 --> 00:39:22,950
with a twist, on a coaster.
放在杯墊上？

655
00:39:23,160 --> 00:39:24,710
Monica?
摩妮卡，摩妮卡

656
00:39:26,490 --> 00:39:28,930
Okay, she was here. But she left.
好吧，她來過，又走了

657
00:39:29,100 --> 00:39:30,490
Where did she go?
她去哪裡？

658
00:39:30,700 --> 00:39:33,320
She said she had to think things over.
她說她要想清楚

659
00:39:33,530 --> 00:39:37,940
Oh,my God. I can't believe this. I thought you were a good guy.
天哪，我真不敢相信 我以為你是個好人

660
00:39:38,140 --> 00:39:39,900
Look,nothing happened.
我們又沒怎樣？

662
00:39:40,110 --> 00:39:44,100
Nothing? So you didn't tell my girlfriend you love her?
沒怎樣？那你沒和我女朋友示愛？

664
00:39:44,440 --> 00:39:47,070
Well, all right, one thing happened.
好吧，只有這樣

665
00:39:47,450 --> 00:39:51,750
You know what you did? My girlfriend is thinking things over.
我真不敢相信 你知道你做了什麼？ 我的女朋友在想事情

667
00:39:51,950 --> 00:39:54,550
You made my girlfriend think!
你讓我的女朋友思考

668
00:39:55,620 --> 00:39:57,380
Well,I'm sorry.
我很抱歉

669
00:39:58,560 --> 00:40:01,390
-What's to think about? I love her. -Well...
她還需要想什麼？我愛她

670
00:40:01,590 --> 00:40:04,890
I'm willing to offer her things that you aren't.
我願意給她你不願意給的東西

671
00:40:05,100 --> 00:40:08,590
I'm willing to offer her those things. I had a plan...
但是我願意給 我只是故意...

672
00:40:08,800 --> 00:40:14,140
to throw her off so when I offered all these things,she'd be surprised.
要讓她失望 等真相大白，她就會很驚喜

674
00:40:14,440 --> 00:40:17,500
If it helps, it worked very well.
那效果真的很好

675
00:40:18,340 --> 00:40:21,750
It was working till you showed up, you big tree.
直到你殺出來，水泥牆

676
00:40:24,220 --> 00:40:26,150
This isn't fair.
這樣不公平

677
00:40:26,350 --> 00:40:29,690
You had your chance with her, and you blew it!
你曾經有機會，結果你搞砸了

678
00:40:29,890 --> 00:40:34,830
This is my chance. I won't blow it, because we are meant for each other.
現在輪到我了，我不會搞砸 因為我們是天生一對

679
00:40:35,030 --> 00:40:38,330
And this has all just been one stupid mistake!
而這一切只是個愚蠢的錯誤

680
00:40:38,900 --> 00:40:41,200
I was gonna propose tonight.
我本來打算今晚求婚的

681
00:40:44,140 --> 00:40:47,770
-You were gonna propose? -Yeah,I even...
你要求婚？ 對，我還…

683
00:40:48,840 --> 00:40:52,110
got a ring. Did you get a ring?
準備了戒指，你有嗎？

684
00:40:52,310 --> 00:40:53,970
No, I don't have a ring.
沒有，我沒準備

685
00:40:59,690 --> 00:41:01,710
You go get her, Chandler.
你去找她吧，錢德

686
00:41:04,320 --> 00:41:06,880
And can I give you a piece of advice?
我可以給你一個忠告嗎？ 

687
00:41:07,090 --> 00:41:08,960
If you do get her...
要是你得到了她

688
00:41:10,030 --> 00:41:11,690
don't let her go.
一定要好好把握

689
00:41:11,860 --> 00:41:13,330
Trust me.
相信我

690
00:41:16,270 --> 00:41:19,760
You know, Richard, you are a good guy.
理查…你的確是個好人

691
00:41:22,110 --> 00:41:23,270
I know.
我知道

692
00:41:24,540 --> 00:41:26,070
I hate that.
真討厭

693
00:41:40,560 --> 00:41:43,150
-I've gotta find Monica. -She's gone.
待會再說，我得去找摩妮卡 她走了

695
00:41:43,530 --> 00:41:46,970
-What? -She had a bag and she left.
-什麼？ -她走了，提著一個包包走了

697
00:41:47,170 --> 00:41:49,130
-What? -She was all crying...
-什麼？ -她哭得很傷心

698
00:41:49,340 --> 00:41:52,670
She said you guys want different things.
說你們要的東西不一樣

699
00:41:52,870 --> 00:41:57,100
-Why didn't you stop her? Why didn't you tell her it was a plan? -I told her everything.
-說她需要時間思考 你為什麼不攔住她？ 不說出我的打算？ -我都說了 

702
00:41:57,310 --> 00:42:01,580
-But she wouldn't believe me. -Well,where..? Where did she go?
-但是她不信  -那她…她上哪去了？

704
00:42:01,780 --> 00:42:07,150
To her parents'. She said you shouldn't call. But if I were you,I would.
她父母家，她叫你不要打給她 不過要是我就會打

706
00:42:07,690 --> 00:42:11,920
-I can't believe I ruined this. -I am so sorry,man.
我居然搞砸了 我很遺憾

708
00:42:23,100 --> 00:42:25,630
You wanted it to be a surprise.
你希望是個驚喜的

709
00:42:35,550 --> 00:42:37,040
Oh,my God.
天哪

710
00:42:43,590 --> 00:42:45,080
Chandler...
錢德…

711
00:42:46,430 --> 00:42:48,390
in all my life...
我這輩子…

712
00:42:49,130 --> 00:42:51,790
I never thought I would be so lucky...
從來沒想過我會這麼幸運

713
00:42:55,370 --> 00:42:58,960
as to fall in love with my best...
可以…愛上我最要好的…

714
00:43:00,370 --> 00:43:01,960
My best...
我最要好的…

715
00:43:03,040 --> 00:43:05,980
There's a reason why girls don't do this! Okay, okay, okay.
所以說都是男人求婚嘛 好好好

716
00:43:06,910 --> 00:43:09,470
I'll do it. I thought...
我來，我以為…

717
00:43:13,920 --> 00:43:15,550
Wait, I can do this.
等等，我一定行

718
00:43:19,490 --> 00:43:22,520
I thought that it mattered...
我以為...

719
00:43:22,730 --> 00:43:26,320
what I said or where I said it.
開口的時間地點很重要

720
00:43:27,030 --> 00:43:29,060
Then I realized...
後來才發現...

721
00:43:29,400 --> 00:43:32,300
the only thing that matters is that you...
唯一重要的是你…

722
00:43:36,210 --> 00:43:40,580
You make me happier than I ever thought I could be.
讓我得到超乎想像的幸福

723
00:43:43,720 --> 00:43:45,620
And if you let me...
所以如果你願意

724
00:43:46,220 --> 00:43:50,590
I'll spend all my life trying to make you feel the same way.
我願意用下半生 讓你跟我一樣幸福

725
00:43:59,500 --> 00:44:00,900
Monica...
摩妮卡…

726
00:44:02,940 --> 00:44:04,400
will you marry me?
你願意嫁給我嗎？

727
00:44:06,640 --> 00:44:08,160
Yes.
我願意

728
00:44:22,120 --> 00:44:25,350
I knew you were likely to take a wife!
我就知道你應該會成親

729
00:44:27,360 --> 00:44:30,520
Can we come in yet? We're dying out here!
可以進去了嗎？我們快憋死了

730
00:44:31,130 --> 00:44:32,650
Come in! Come in!
進來，進來

731
00:44:34,770 --> 00:44:36,600
We're engaged!
我們訂婚了

732
00:44:43,280 --> 00:44:46,210
This is the least jealous I've ever been.
這是我最不嫉妒的時候

733
00:44:46,850 --> 00:44:50,080
Oh, no, wait! This is wrong! Ross isn't here!
等等，不行啦，羅斯不在

734
00:44:52,080 --> 00:44:56,150
Hell, he's done it three times. He knows what it's about!
他都玩三次了 知道是怎麼回事

735
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


736
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
